{#
  Custom error page example (10.6).

  In production (APP_DEBUG off) the framework renders HTML errors through
  host templates when they exist, looked up in this order:

      views/errors/{status}.twig      e.g. errors/404.twig, errors/503.twig
      views/errors/{4xx|5xx}.twig     status-class fallback
      built-in branded page           when neither exists (or a template throws)

  Available context:
      status        the HTTP status code (int)
      message       the client-safe message (already production-filtered)
      request_path  the path that errored

  A template error never breaks the response — it is logged to
  var/logs/view.log and the built-in branded page is served instead. In debug
  mode the rich debug page always wins; API/JSON responses are never templated.

  This example mirrors the framework's built-in branded page
  (Ions\Http\Ui\ErrorPage), inlining the same dark/indigo palette so a host
  override stays visually consistent. Edit freely — it is yours.
#}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{{ status }} — {{ message }}</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: dark light;
            --ion-bg: #101218;
            --ion-text: #d8dce3;
            --ion-muted: #9aa4b2;
            --ion-accent: #818cf8;
            --ion-border: #2a2e36;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0; min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.5; background: var(--ion-bg); color: var(--ion-text);
        }
        main { text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem; max-width: 32rem; }
        .status { font-size: 6rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0; color: var(--ion-accent); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
        .title { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin: .75rem 0 0; }
        .message { margin: .5rem 0 1.5rem; color: var(--ion-muted); }
        .home {
            display: inline-block; color: var(--ion-accent); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;
            padding: .5rem 1rem; border: 1px solid var(--ion-border); border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .home:hover { border-color: var(--ion-accent); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
    <p class="status">{{ status }}</p>
    <h1 class="title">Page Not Found</h1>
    <p class="message">{{ message }}</p>
    <p><a class="home" href="/">Back to the homepage</a></p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
